      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### External sites\n\n* Code coverage & benchmarks: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36637\n* Ralph review <img src=https://review.fish.foo/assets/bitcoin/bitcoin/36637.png alt=\"Ralph review status\"> https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36637#author-ralph\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\n| Type | Reviewers |\n| ---- | --------- |\n| ACK | [vasild](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36637#pullrequestreview-5638420552) |\n| Concept ACK | [winterrdog](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36637#pullrequestreview-5638016616) |\n\nIf your review is incorrectly listed, please copy-paste <code>&lt;!--meta-tag:bot-skip--&gt;</code> into the comment that the bot should ignore.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#36374](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36374) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36374.svg\"></sub> (torcontrol: escape backslashes in -torpassword by 0xShadowX)\n* [#36170](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36170) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36170.svg\"></sub> (net: require a dedicated bind for automatic Tor by l0rinc)\n* [#36142](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36142) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36142.svg\"></sub> (net: validate Tor onion service replies and cached keys by l0rinc)\n\nIf you consider this pull request important, please also help to review the conflicting pull requests. Ideally, start with the one that should be merged first.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->",
